    "fylite:name": "JINTRAC case04 · JET #58894（JETTO+EIRENE，本仓跑不动）",
    "fylite:name_en": "JINTRAC case04 - JET #58894 (JETTO+EIRENE; this repository cannot run it)",
    "fylite:needs": [
      "JET #58894 的机器与放电参数（R0 / a / B0 / Ip / 剖面初值）——**源文档没有给**，算例里这些控件是本仓的占位，不是这一炮的数",
      "一张 63.38–63.58 s 的参考平衡与剖面（JETTO JSP/JST 或等价件），用「导入」喂进来"
    ],
    "fylite:needs_en": [
      "JET #58894 machine and discharge parameters (R0 / a / B0 / Ip / initial profiles) -- THE SOURCE DOCUMENT DOES NOT GIVE THEM; the controls in this case are this repository's placeholders, not that pulse's numbers",
      "A reference equilibrium and profiles over 63.38-63.58 s (JETTO JSP/JST or equivalent), fed through Import"
    ],
    "fylite:source": "《Progress of JINTRAC Deployment on the ASIPP Cluster》Xiaojuan Liu, 2026-08-28（Test Case Matrix）",
    "fylite:source_en": "'Progress of JINTRAC Deployment on the ASIPP Cluster', Xiaojuan Liu, 2026-08-28 (Test Case Matrix)",
    "fylite:note": "★★这一档**本仓跑不动**，缺的不是数据而是**物理模块**：它的判据是 JETTO 芯部与 EIRENE 中性粒子的**反馈闭合**（电离 / 电荷交换 / 复合与再循环源），而本仓没有中性粒子输运，一个也没有。源文档记：JET #58894，63.38–63.58 s，作业 101612，**12 次 EIRENE 调用**自然跑完。★算例仍然收在这里，因为「缺哪一块」要有个**具名的去处**——`fylite cases --plan` 会把它逐条报出来，而不是让人从缺席里推。★配置里的机器与剖面控件是**本仓的占位**：源文档没有给这一炮的参数，编一份就是假数。",
    "fylite:note_en": "★★This repository CANNOT run this case, and what is missing is not data but a PHYSICS MODULE: its acceptance is the feedback closure between the JETTO core and EIRENE neutrals (ionization / charge exchange / recombination and recycling sources), and this repository has no neutral-particle transport at all. The source records: JET #58894, 63.38-63.58 s, job 101612, completed naturally with 12 EIRENE calls. ★It is kept here so that「缺哪一块」has a NAMED place to be read off: `fylite cases --plan` reports it row by row rather than leaving a reader to infer it from an absence. ★The machine and profile controls are this repository's PLACEHOLDERS: the source gives no parameters for that pulse, and inventing a set would be fabricated data."
  },
